meta-df-stm32mp157c-dk2
=======================

Machine-specific part of the DontFall custom layer (meta-df) for the
STM32MP157C-DK2 Discovery kit.

It provides the `stm32mp157c-dk2` machine configuration, derived from the
meta-st-stm32mp `stm32mp15-disco` machine but building the
`stm32mp157c-dk2` devicetrees, plus the matching WIC kickstart files.

Usage:

  * add `meta-df/meta-df-stm32mp157c-dk2` (and `meta-df/meta-df-common`)
    to BBLAYERS
  * build with `MACHINE = "stm32mp157c-dk2"`

To also generate a raw sdcard image, set in local.conf:

  WKS_IMAGE_FSTYPES += "wic wic.bz2 wic.bmap"
  WKS_FILE += "${OPTEEMIN_WIC_FILE}"
